WEBVTT

00:10:28.914 --> 00:10:33.424
because there are a lot of countries today
that do not have Internet access,

00:10:33.424 --> 00:10:36.936
they do not have the means 
to be able to do online education.

00:10:36.936 --> 00:10:39.155
So, when we think about education,

00:10:39.155 --> 00:10:42.975
we cannot just think it 
from our own setting.

00:10:42.975 --> 00:10:45.125
If we are really 
going to look into models,

00:10:45.125 --> 00:10:47.798
we need to take care of those countries

00:10:47.798 --> 00:10:51.088
that are in need of education
to change their life,

00:10:51.088 --> 00:10:53.038
and this is where what I'm saying

00:10:53.038 --> 00:10:55.943
related to what some 
universities have started

00:10:55.943 --> 00:11:00.717
like MicroMasters
or many bachelor's degrees